{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14688","headline":"将赴湖南留别东阳旧僚兼示吏人 · 戴叔伦","name":"将赴湖南留别东阳旧僚兼示吏人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"智力苦不足，黎甿殊未安。\n忽从新命去，复隔旧寮欢。\n晓路整车马，离亭会衣冠。\n冰坚细流咽，烧尽乱峯寒。\n耆老相饯送，儿童亦悲酸。\n桐乡寄生怨，欲话此情难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14688.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14688","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}